Follow `CONTEXT.md` and `AGENTS.md`. Prefer small, reviewable changes.

## Error ratcheting

Constraints in `.cursor/hooks.json`, `.cursor/hooks/`, and `.cursor/rules/` may only be
tightened. Never delete, empty, or weaken an existing ratchet. If a hook blocks
legitimate work, open a `signal-up` Linear issue instead (see `docs/agents/signal-up.md`
and `docs/agents/error-ratcheting.md`).
